1
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:38,640
Has the Seventh Prince already rejected you?

2
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:40,400
Not exactly

3
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:42,520
I was once trapped in dire straits

4
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:44,400
It was the Seventh Prince who saved me

5
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:49,120
But it was Zhu Huaichen who rescued Duan Yurou at the brothel

6
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:52,720
How did it become Zhu Huaijin in this lifetime?

7
00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:03,720
Steward Duan, where is Hua Mei now?

8
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:06,760
She's in her room

9
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:08,240
Not allowing anyone to enter

10
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:10,160
Does the Princess Consort wish to see her?

11
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:13,000
Why won't she let anyone in?

12
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:14,720
You don't know?

13
00:01:15,080 --> 00:01:17,800
This Steward Duan... under the Third Prince's command

14
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:20,760
Her life isn't as glorious as it appears

15
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:22,280
Every now and then

16
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:24,480
She drives everyone out

17
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:26,280
To secretly apply medicine to herself

18
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:39,840
Steward Duan

19
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:40,600
Who's there?

20
00:01:40,960 --> 00:01:41,920
Steward Duan

21
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:44,440
If the Princess Consort is blind, she shouldn't wander about recklessly

22
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:48,800
I...

23
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,640
What did I just scrape against?

24
00:01:57,960 --> 00:01:59,280
Steward Duan is injured.

25
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:01,840
I grew up in military camps

26
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:04,200
What kind of injury do you have?

27
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,560
I can tell just by touch

28
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:08,080
Your wound is on the back

29
00:02:09,160 --> 00:02:11,000
You probably can't apply medicine there yourself

30
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:14,160
I brought premium golden wound ointment

31
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,280
Let me help you

32
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:18,960
Don't bother

33
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,680
No need to hide, Steward Duan

34
00:02:34,440 --> 00:02:35,240
She...

35
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:38,120
She's actually helping me apply medicine

36
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:40,360
Why?

37
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:42,240
Besides the Seventh Prince

38
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,960
No one has ever cared whether I live or die

39
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:46,880
Unrequested kindness

40
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:47,800
Always has ulterior motives

41
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:50,120
Do you need something from me?

42
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:51,840
You're overthinking it

43
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:53,960
As fellow women

44
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:57,320
I just can't bear to see you hurt like this

45
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:02,680
Who could have injured Steward Duan this badly?

46
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,200
None of your business

47
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:09,760
I know the Seventh Prince saved you

48
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:12,840
But you shouldn't have to endure such humiliation from him

49
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:16,160
Nonsense! The Seventh Prince isn't that kind of person

50
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:18,360
Who's spreading these malicious rumors about him?

51
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:21,640
You defend him so fiercely

52
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:23,880
But people's hearts are hidden behind ribs

53
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:26,520
What if even when he saved you

54
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:27,960
it was all part of his elaborate scheme?

55
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:30,880
Then wouldn't your devotion be misplaced?

56
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:34,320
Absolutely impossible!

57
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,800
Don't try to sow discord here

58
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:40,720
You have no idea

59
00:03:41,960 --> 00:03:43,720
what really happened back then

60
00:03:44,640 --> 00:03:45,360
You refuse to entertain guests

61
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:46,320
You refuse to obey

62
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:48,240
I'll teach you to disobey

63
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:50,640
I'll teach you to disobey! Who's there?

64
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,480
You two, attack now!

65
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:09,840
Get lost!

66
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:25,000
Come with me

67
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:32,880
She just falls for whoever saves her

68
00:04:33,480 --> 00:04:35,200
And would give her life for them

69
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:37,520
It was Zhu Huaichen before

70
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,320
Now it's Zhu Huaijin

71
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,960
This is way too self-deprecating

72
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,960
That woodshed

73
00:04:45,440 --> 00:04:47,320
Ordinary people can't get in

74
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,520
The Seventh Prince

75
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:52,640
He seems to have come just for me

76
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:57,400
As if our meeting was destined by fate

77
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:08,200
He came specifically for you

78
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:12,120
I didn't expect Zhu Huaijin to be reborn earlier than me

79
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:15,280
No wonder he could set up such an elaborate scheme in advance

80
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:19,680
Zhu Huaijin took advantage of Duan Yurou's genuine feelings for him

81
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:21,800
And trapped her in this predicament

82
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:26,160
These tactics are just like how Zhu Huaichen used me before

83
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:30,560
Truly inheriting the same cruel and ruthless nature

84
00:05:34,520 --> 00:05:35,840
You truly care for him

85
00:05:36,360 --> 00:05:37,840
Does he truly care for you?

86
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,680
One must persist in doing good

87
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:44,440
If you follow the wrong person

88
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,760
you'll face eternal damnation

89
00:05:47,960 --> 00:05:49,040
Blind fool

90
00:05:49,520 --> 00:05:51,920
Who are you to lecture me from your high horse?

91
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,960
The Seventh Prince doesn't truly care for me

92
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:55,000
Do you think he cares for you?

93
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:19,600
Seems we're thinking alike

94
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:21,360
Have a seat

95
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:24,040
I also have something to tell you

96
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:32,560
I just need your honest word to prove your sincerity

97
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,520
Just tell me everything

98
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:36,840
I'm willing to hear your reasons

99
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:39,640
If you keep lying to me

100
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:42,000
Zhi'an

101
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:45,360
I was wrong about what happened the other day

102
00:06:45,880 --> 00:06:47,000
Don't be angry, alright?

103
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,280
I'm not angry

104
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:12,600
Just somewhat confused

105
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,400
It seems

106
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:18,400
the person who clashed with me that day

107
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,200
wasn't really you

108
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:23,440
In our daily interactions

109
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:26,480
you're gentle, devoted, and always caring

110
00:07:27,960 --> 00:07:29,080
The person I love

111
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:31,520
is definitely not the one who drew a sword on me

112
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:36,200
but the one who's always protected and guarded me

113
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:40,240
Am I making myself clear?

114
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:43,720
Seventh Prince
